{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051920/extras/ca5ddca8623d467e4ba887c0e0cfedeb.avif?t=1758828424\" width=780 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051920/extras/d4447c1f66f25dd103999ef433a3b6a3.poster.avif?t=1758828424\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051920/extras/d4447c1f66f25dd103999ef433a3b6a3.webm?t=1758828424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051920/extras/d4447c1f66f25dd103999ef433a3b6a3.mp4?t=1758828424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head to the Hermes Hotel. My contact is waiting \u2014 she\u2019ll guide you on the best way to reach Mino. He\u2019s hiding some details, and I need you to uncover them. When you meet him, secure his ledger and gather intel on whiskey suppliers in Mexico. No one else knows you\u2019re coming; let\u2019s keep this a surprise for Mino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Dan \u2014 try to get it done without causing too much trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo presents the complete prologue of the game BOILED. Dan\u2019s adventure begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, you\u2019ll experience:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 of the 3 prologue maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The full story setup and an introduction to the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Adrenaline-fueled gameplay with tactical freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-No procedural generation. No neural networks. Only human-drawn, hand-designed levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Like in the good old games.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051920?t=1758828424","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4051920?t=1758828424","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051920/6613d3e7cbf6911c7a3288f61a5bd379a1d3a478/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758828424","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051920/6613d3e7cbf6911c7a3288f61a5bd379a1d3a478/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758828424","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051920/extras/ca5ddca8623d467e4ba887c0e0cfedeb.avif?t=1758828424\" width=780 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051920/extras/d4447c1f66f25dd103999ef433a3b6a3.poster.avif?t=1758828424\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051920/extras/d4447c1f66f25dd103999ef433a3b6a3.webm?t=1758828424\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051920/extras/d4447c1f66f25dd103999ef433a3b6a3.mp4?t=1758828424\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Head to the Hermes Hotel. My contact is waiting \u2014 she\u2019ll guide you on the best way to reach Mino. He\u2019s hiding some details, and I need you to uncover them. When you meet him, secure his ledger and gather intel on whiskey suppliers in Mexico. No one else knows you\u2019re coming; let\u2019s keep this a surprise for Mino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And Dan \u2014 try to get it done without causing too much trouble.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo presents the complete prologue of the game BOILED. Dan\u2019s adventure begins here.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the demo, you\u2019ll experience:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- 2 of the 3 prologue maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-The full story setup and an introduction to the protagonist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Adrenaline-fueled gameplay with tactical freedom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-No procedural generation. No neural networks. Only human-drawn, hand-designed levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Like in the good old games.</p>","developers":["Classified Office"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3474390","name":"BOILED"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051920/430dd3ae4b446666e27ee906c2f450f17845ad98/header.jpg?t=1758828424","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4051920/361803092/d21fa55ae93ec81d68d59a4ed2bc3dc4a9c8bffe/1758750541/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758828422","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4051920/361803092/d21fa55ae93ec81d68d59a4ed2bc3dc4a9c8bffe/1758750541/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758828422","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4051920/361803092/d21fa55ae93ec81d68d59a4ed2bc3dc4a9c8bffe/1758750541/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758828422","id":257205720,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205720/movie480.mp4?t=1758828422","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257205720/movie_max.mp4?t=1758828422"},"name":"The Demo is Coming Soon","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257205720/211a11147ef642f923237d8351992777fbe4af9c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1758828422","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_tra